{"id": "22-4249-2-35", "zh": "640. Lahussupantassa（轻音的近尾音）〔ka.485；rū.434；nī.975；caṃ.6.1.105-106……乃至……7.3.77-78〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4250-2-25", "zh": "在末尾附近出现的叫作 upanta（近尾音），以辅音结尾的词根，其（末辅音）前面的元音就称为‘近尾音’。轻音并且是近尾音的 i 类元音和 u 类元音，分别增强为 e 和 o。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4251-2-7", "zh": "ira 意为颤动：erati、modati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4252-2-4", "zh": "为什么说‘轻音的’？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4252-5-12", "zh": "例如 jīvati、dhūpati、ikkhati、sukkhati。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4253-2-4", "zh": "为什么说‘近尾音的’？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4253-5-14", "zh": "例如 siñcati、bhuñjati：因为插入了鼻音（niggahīta）而被隔开，所以不是近尾音。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4254-2-3", "zh": "为什么说‘i 类元音和 u 类元音的’？", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4254-4-7", "zh": "例如 pacati、vadati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4255-2-12", "zh": "依这条规则，i 增强为 e：esati、anvesati、pariyesati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4256-2-6", "zh": "前加 adhi 的 isu 意为恳请：ajjhesati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4257-2-9", "zh": "被动语态：esīyati、pariyesīyati、anvesīyati、ajjhesīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4258-2-9", "zh": "使役：eseti、esayati、esāpeti、esāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4259-2-13", "zh": "isu 意为希求，（s）替换为 cch：icchati、icchanti、sampaṭicchati、sampaṭicchanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4260-2-3", "zh": "被动语态：icchīyati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4261-2-9", "zh": "使役：icchāpeti、icchāpayati、sampaṭicchāpeti、sampaṭicchāpayati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4262-2-15", "zh": "被动语态：icchāpīyati、icchāpayīyati；so icchi、te icchiṃsu、icchissati、icchissanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4263-2-33", "zh": "kamu 意为穿透：在深奥的地方，智慧能够穿透（kamati）；刀剑不能穿透，毒不能穿透，火不能穿透〔a.ni.8.1〕——意思是不能刺入。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4264-2-22", "zh": "kamu 意为举步行走：pakkamati、apakkamati、upakkamati、vikkamati、abhikkamati、paṭikkamati、atikkamati、saṅkamati、okkamati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4265-2-20", "zh": "641. Nito kamassa（ni 之后的 kamu）〔ka.20；rū.27；nī.50〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4266-2-8", "zh": "在 ni 之后的 kamu，其 k 变为 kh。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4266-9-16", "zh": "由于有‘Ādissā’（词首的）这一规定，可知指的是 k。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4267-2-5", "zh": "nikkhamati、nikkhamanti。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "22-4268-2-3", "zh": "使役——", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4269-2-20", "zh": "642. Assā ṇānubandhe（带 ṇ 附标时，a 变为 ā）〔ka.483；rū.527；nī.973〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4270-2-10", "zh": "以辅音结尾的词根，在带 ṇ 附标的词缀之前，词首的 a 增强为 ā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4270-11-19", "zh": "由于‘Bahulaṃ’（多样适用）这一条贯通管辖，在 ṇāpi 之前不作 ā 增强。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4271-2-13", "zh": "pakkāmeti、pakkāmayati、nikkhāmeti、nikkhāmayati、nikkhamāpeti、nikkhamāpayati。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "22-4272-2-62", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾之前，依大释规则（mahāvutti），词首元音可以变长：so pakkami、pakkāmi；“idaṃ vatvāna pakkāmi, maddī sabbaṅgasobhaṇā”（全身美好的玛德丽说完这话就离开了）〔jā.2.22.1857〕；pakkamuṃ、pakkāmuṃ；“sammodamānā pakkāmuṃ, aññamaññaṃ piyaṃ vadā”（他们彼此说着亲切的话，欢喜地离开了）〔jā.2.22.1868〕；pakkamiṃsu、pakkāmiṃsu、pakkamaṃsu、pakkāmaṃsu、pakkamissati、pakkamissanti、pakkamissare。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4273-2-11", "zh": "前加 ā 的 kusa 意为辱骂，因为近尾音是轻音，所以增强：akkosati、akkosanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4273-12-18", "zh": "前加 pa 意为召唤：pakkosati、pakkosanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4273-19-25", "zh": "前加 vi 意为高声呼喊：vikkosati、vikkosanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4273-26-32", "zh": "前加 paṭi 意为拒斥：paṭikkosati、paṭikkosanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4274-2-4", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾之前——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4275-2-27", "zh": "643. Kusaruhīssacchi（kusa、ruha 之后的 ī 变为 cchi）〔ka.498；rū.480；nī.1114；多数版本作‘kusaruhehīssa chi’〕。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4276-2-9", "zh": "在 kusa 和 ruha 之后的 ī，变为 cchi。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4277-2-32", "zh": "“akkocchi maṃ avadhi maṃ”（他辱骂我，他打我）〔dha.pa.3-4〕；也有人用 kudha、kupa 词根来构成这个词形，如果是这样，读法就应当是“akkocchi me”。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4277-33-36", "zh": "akkosi、akkosiṃsu。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "22-4278-2-18", "zh": "gamu 意为行走，主动语态加 la 词缀，依‘ūlasse’规则，la 变为 e：gameti、gamenti。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4278-19-34", "zh": "前加 ava 意为了知：avagameti、avagamenti；前加 adhi 意为了知和获得：adhigameti、adhigamenti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4278-35-41", "zh": "前加 vi 意为离去：vigameti、vigamenti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4279-2-7", "zh": "被动语态：gamīyati、gamiyati、gamiyyati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4280-2-17", "zh": "同化为前音时：gammati、gammanti、adhigammati、adhigammanti、adhigammare、adhigammate、adhigammante、adhigammare。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4281-2-13", "zh": "使役时不作增强：gameti、gamayati、gamāpeti、gamāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4282-2-9", "zh": "被动语态：gamayīyati、gamayīyanti、gamāpīyati、gamāpīyanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4283-2-53", "zh": "过去时（hiyyattanī）：so agamā、gamā，te agamū、gamū，tvaṃ agamo、agama、agami，tumhe agamuttha，ahaṃ agamiṃ、gamiṃ，mayaṃ agamamhā、gamamhā、agamumhā、gamumhā，so agamattha，te agamatthuṃ，tvaṃ agamase，tumhe agamavhaṃ，ahaṃ agamaṃ，mayaṃ agamamhase。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4284-2-10", "zh": "不定过去时（ajjattanī）中，在 ī 等词尾之前插入 i 音：so agamī、gamī。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4285-2-5", "zh": "变为短音时：agami、gami。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4286-2-16", "zh": "依大释规则，连同 ā 一起插入 s：so agamāsi；gāmaṃ agamāsi（去了村子），nagaraṃ agamāsi（去了城里）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4287-2-19", "zh": "依‘Eyyāthasse’等规则，ī 变为 ttho：so gāmaṃ agamittho、gamittho，te agamuṃ、gamuṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4288-2-23", "zh": "依‘Uṃssiṃsvaṃsū’规则，（uṃ 变为）iṃsu、aṃsu：te agamiṃsu、gamiṃsu、agamaṃsu、gamaṃsu，tvaṃ agamo、gamo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4289-2-38", "zh": "依‘Ossa a i ttha ttho’与‘sī’两条规则：tvaṃ agama、gama、agami、gami、agamittha、gamittha、agamittho、gamittho、agamāsi、gamāsi，tumhe agamittha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4290-2-26", "zh": "依‘Mhātthānamuu’规则变为 u：tumhe agamuttha、gamuttha，ahaṃ agamiṃ、gamiṃ、agamāsiṃ、gamāsiṃ，mayaṃ agamimhā、gamimhā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4291-2-21", "zh": "变为短音时：agamimha、gamimha、agamumhā、gamumhā、agamumha、gamumha、agamāsimhā、gamāsimhā、agamāsimha、gamāsimha。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4292-2-6", "zh": "在后六个词尾（反身态）中：so agamā、gamā。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4293-2-5", "zh": "变为短音时：agama、gama。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4294-2-15", "zh": "依‘Eyyāthasse’等规则变为 ttha 时：so agamittha、gamittha，te agamū、gamū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4295-2-29", "zh": "变为短音时：agamu、gamu，tvaṃ agamise、gamise，tumhe agamivhaṃ、gamivhaṃ，ahaṃ agama、gama，或作 agamaṃ、gamaṃ，agamimhe、gamimhe。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4296-2-25", "zh": "被动语态：agamīyi、agammi、agamīyittho、agammittho、agamīyuṃ、gamīyuṃ、agamīyiṃsu、gamīyiṃsu、agammuṃ、gammuṃ、agammiṃsu、gammiṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4297-2-9", "zh": "在后六个词尾中：agamīyittha、gamīyittha、agammittha、gammittha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4298-2-17", "zh": "使役：agamāpayi、gamāpayi、agamāpesi、gamāpesi、agamāpayuṃ、gamāpayuṃ、agamāpayiṃsu、gamāpayiṃsu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4299-2-19", "zh": "644. Gamissa（gamu 的）〔ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4300-2-10", "zh": "在 ā 等词尾和 ī 等词尾之前，gamu 的 m 变为 ā。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4300-11-12", "zh": "（随后）元音脱落。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4301-2-19", "zh": "so agā，te agū，tvaṃ ago，tumhe aguttha，ahaṃ agaṃ，mayaṃ agumhā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4302-2-27", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾之前，ī 元音脱落：“agā devāna santike”（去到了诸天身边）〔jā.1.14.205〕，“vāyaso anupariyagā”（乌鸦绕着飞了一圈）〔su.ni.449〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4303-2-32", "zh": "前加 ā 意为到来：“anavhito tato āgā”（没有受到召唤，就从那里来了）〔jā.1.5.21〕，“sopāgā samitiṃ vanaṃ”（他也来到了林中的集会）〔dī.ni.2.335〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4304-2-25", "zh": "前加 adhi 意为获得：“ajjhagā amataṃ santiṃ”（证得了不死的寂静）〔vi.va.846〕，“taṇhānaṃ khayamajjhagā”（证得了诸渴爱的灭尽）〔dha.pa.154〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4305-2-22", "zh": "前加 ati，以及前加 upa 和 adhi，意为越过：“nakkhattaṃ paṭimānentaṃ, attho bālaṃ upajjhagā”（愚人一味等待吉时，利益就从他身边错过了）〔jā.1.1.49〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4305-23-27", "zh": "“khaṇo ve mā upajjhagā”（不要让时机从身边错过）。", "confidence": 72}
